                                "sense_id": "b6c161d9-ed76-32f1-8123-053bb682f9d8",
                                "text": "Floating wire hardwall, softwall, and corrugated hardwall constructions are available in a variety of cover materials, such as neoprene, natural rubber, butyl, which the manufacturer reports meet practically every application requirement in the bulk materials handling field."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f830408b-a592-43b9-896f-d3b7b6d9c6fa",
                                "sense_id": "b6c161d9-ed76-32f1-8123-053bb682f9d8",
                                "text": "The Hardwall Flat[…]Figure 3 shows how a soft or hardwall flat can be made to stand on its own, away from a studio wall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "13b6a1f7-c6cb-47a5-bb7a-19b14be7c229",
                                "sense_id": "b6c161d9-ed76-32f1-8123-053bb682f9d8",
                                "text": "Although television stations and non-broadcast production houses use hardwall scenery almost exclusively, softwall scenery is more practical for high-school and college television operations."
                            }
                        ]
