                                "sense_id": "8b966f1a-d79e-3ae9-a4c4-dbac139d228a",
                                "text": "Keen's cement finish bonds best to a base of strongly gauged Keen's cement mortar, but the addition of lime putty increases its bonding qualities when applied over a hardwall, lime mortar, or Portland cement base coat."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f864f310-f993-46fd-b461-5660d965b4d9",
                                "sense_id": "8b966f1a-d79e-3ae9-a4c4-dbac139d228a",
                                "text": "Hardwall-grade calcined gypsum ( +90 percent Casoy ) passes over a vibrating scrcen fitted with a 50-mesh screen;"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c782d68d-6500-485d-9a4b-1a2627b2b258",
                                "sense_id": "8b966f1a-d79e-3ae9-a4c4-dbac139d228a",
                                "text": "When EPA promulgated its final AHERA regulations on October 30, 1987, the regulations did not mention sheetrock, drywall, gypsum wallboard or hardwall plaster as ACM."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d991d315-afec-4360-b222-662e41675cc5",
                                "sense_id": "8b966f1a-d79e-3ae9-a4c4-dbac139d228a",
                                "text": "Hardwall is similar to browning except that it offers a higher impact resistance and quicker drying surface."
                            }
                        ]
